WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:06,820
It's Jian Tong

2
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,770
What can you say to plead for me?

3
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:13,450
It’s just a liar. Wei Shan doesn’t have her.

4
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,410
Why do you say these things?

5
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,760
Jian Tong, what’s wrong?

6
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,200
like this

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,280
I said Jian Tong

8
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,680
I don’t think you’re in the public relations department either.

9
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,920
It's embarrassing

10
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,520
How long have you been doing nothing, Jenny?

11
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:30,840
Just don’t take your little money

12
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:32,400
Dazzled in front of Jian Tong

13
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,960
Ren Jian Tong makes a lot of money, you know this

14
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,400
You can't stand anyone's eyes at all.

15
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,480
That's true

16
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,760
Who can be as flexible and flexible as she is?

17
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,560
No matter how much money you have

18
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:51,180
I don't want to stop Jian Tong

19
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,220
What do you mean I'm talking to you?

20
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,700
You just left without saying a word.

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,060
you look down on me

22
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,620
time has come

23
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,620
I'm off work
